<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 25/26.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MARCH 25/26.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for March</p>
<p>25/26 at 1100GMT. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons</p>
<p>to a German mark.</p>
<p>March 25/26  March 24/25</p>
<p> CZK	0.46152	0.46189</p>
<p> DKK	2.09862	2.09824</p>
<p> FIM	2.67526	2.67918</p>
<p> HUF	0.07636	0.07646</p>
<p> JPY	0.10929	0.11001</p>
<p> LTL	3.3708	 3.38231</p>
<p> LVL     23.20489     23.26666</p>
<p> RUR	0.00239	0.00237</p>
<p> SEK	1.76402	1.7707</p>
<p> UAH	7.31788	7.30771</p>
<p> USD     13.4832	13.5284</p>
<p> XEU     15.53602     15.52722</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400 or reuters@reuters.ee</p>
